#: ../../src/guide/eventloops.rst:2
msgid "Advanced event loops"
msgstr "高级事件循环"

#: ../../src/guide/eventloops.rst:4
msgid ""
"libuv provides considerable user control over event loops, and you can "
"achieve interesting results by juggling multiple loops. You can also "
"embed libuv's event loop into another event loop based library -- imagine"
" a Qt based UI, and Qt's event loop driving a libuv backend which does "
"intensive system level tasks."
msgstr "libuv 为用户提供了对事件循环相当可观的控制能力，通过同时驾驭多个循环可以获得有趣的效果。你还可以把 libuv 的事件循环嵌入另一个基于事件循环的库——想象一个基于 Qt 的 UI，由 Qt 的事件循环驱动一个 libuv 后端去完成繁重的系统级任务。"

#: ../../src/guide/eventloops.rst:11
msgid "Stopping an event loop"
msgstr "停止事件循环"

#: ../../src/guide/eventloops.rst:13
msgid ""
"``uv_stop()`` can be used to stop an event loop. The earliest the loop "
"will stop running is *on the next iteration*, possibly later. This means "
"that events that are ready to be processed in this iteration of the loop "
"will still be processed, so ``uv_stop()`` can't be used as a kill switch."
" When ``uv_stop()`` is called, the loop **won't** block for i/o on this "
"iteration. The semantics of these things can be a bit difficult to "
"understand, so let's look at ``uv_run()`` where all the control flow "
"occurs."
msgstr "``uv_stop()`` 可用于停止事件循环。循环最早会在 *下一次迭代* 停止运行，也可能更晚。这意味着本轮循环迭代中已经就绪待处理的事件仍会得到处理，因此 ``uv_stop()`` 不能用作强制终止的开关。当 ``uv_stop()`` 被调用时，循环在这一轮迭代中 **不会** 在 I/O 上阻塞。这些行为的语义可能有点难以理解，我们来看看 ``uv_run()``，所有控制流都发生在其中。"

#: ../../src/guide/eventloops.rst:21
msgid "src/unix/core.c - uv_run"
msgstr "src/unix/core.c - uv_run"

#: ../../src/guide/eventloops.rst:28
msgid ""
"``stop_flag`` is set by ``uv_stop()``. Now all libuv callbacks are "
"invoked within the event loop, which is why invoking ``uv_stop()`` in "
"them will still lead to this iteration of the loop occurring. First libuv"
" updates timers, then runs pending timer, idle and prepare callbacks, and"
" invokes any pending I/O callbacks. If you were to call ``uv_stop()`` in "
"any of them, ``stop_flag`` would be set. This causes "
"``uv_backend_timeout()`` to return ``0``, which is why the loop does not "
"block on I/O. If on the other hand, you called ``uv_stop()`` in one of "
"the check handlers, I/O has already finished and is not affected."
msgstr "``stop_flag`` 由 ``uv_stop()`` 设置。如今所有 libuv 回调都在事件循环之内被调用，这就是为什么在其中调用 ``uv_stop()`` 仍会导致本轮循环迭代发生。libuv 首先更新定时器，然后运行待处理的 timer、idle 和 prepare 回调，并调用任何待处理的 I/O 回调。如果你在其中任何一个回调里调用 ``uv_stop()``，``stop_flag`` 就会被置位。这会使 ``uv_backend_timeout()`` 返回 ``0``，这就是循环不在 I/O 上阻塞的原因。而另一方面，如果你是在某个 check 处理函数中调用 ``uv_stop()``，那么 I/O 已经完成，不会受到影响。"

#: ../../src/guide/eventloops.rst:38
msgid ""
"``uv_stop()`` is useful to shutdown a loop when a result has been "
"computed or there is an error, without having to ensure that all handlers"
" are stopped one by one."
msgstr "当已经计算出结果或发生错误时，``uv_stop()`` 很适合用来关闭循环，而不必确保把所有句柄逐一停止。"

